40","kind":"update","title":"Huge Update for the Demo","summary":"Hey Weaponsmiths!Steam Next Fest is LIVE, and Fantasy Weaponsmith Simulator is part of it.To celebrate, I've just released a huge demo update!The main change is haggling, which I rebuilt from scratch. Customers now make real counteroffers, and you can see their patience run out. Push your price too far and they get offended. If you don't like the deal, you can refuse the sale and keep your sword.There's also a long list of quality-of-life improvements across crafting, commissions and the tutoria","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:00:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691458","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:55:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4659840-1846651706688993","game_id":"steam-4659840","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update v0.7.0","summary":"Haggling, ReworkedOne price on the table. The haggle panel now shows a single price. Set it digit by digit (step the ones, tens or hundreds up and down), then hold to submit.At the customer's price the button reads Sell, and above it the button reads Offer, so you always know which one you're doing.Customers make real counteroffers. Their offer starts at the weapon's market value and only ever goes up. Asking a bit too much won't cost you money, only their patience.The closer your ask is to what","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T06:40:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706688993","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:55:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4659840-1845383656394092","game_id":"steam-4659840","kind":"announcement","title":"This makes the weapons look 100x cooler","summary":"Greetings Weaponsmith,Welcome back to another devlog! I've been looking forward to this one. The feature I'm covering today adds a lot of flavor to arena combat, and it makes the weapons look even cooler.Quick side note before we start: Fantasy Weaponsmith Simulator is taking part in Steam Next Fest later this month! Ahead of it I'll release a quality-of-life update for the Demo, based on all the feedback you've given me so far. If you've played it already, it's worth another look.Today we'll be","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-05T17:00:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656394092","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:55:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4659840-1844115010503301","game_id":"steam-4659840","kind":"announcement","title":"Engrave cool patterns on your weapons!","summary":"Hey weaponsmiths!The demo went live a few days ago. If you've had a chance to play it — thank you, genuinely. And if you've got thoughts, good or bad, I want to hear them.Today I'll continue with another mechanic deep dive. This time it's the Engraving StationWhat is it?It's where you inscribe a weapon with a lore — an engraving that grants stat buffs and stamps the weapon with its own unique tag. While you're there, you can also rename the weapon to whatever you want.One catch: a weapon can onl","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-22T06:27:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010503301","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:55:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4659840-1843481262701675","game_id":"steam-4659840","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo is OUT!","summary":"Demo is RELEASED!Hey Weaponsmiths!It's finally here!The demo is live, and you can now try a slice of the game.I'm both thrilled and terrified to finally put this in players' hands. It's been a long road of passion, late nights, and more than a few setbacks, but I'm finally able to have something to show.So go forge something, haggle hard, and let me know what you think. Every bit of feedback helps shape where this goes next.Another update coming soon ~ Stay tuned!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-14T13:24:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262701675","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:55:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4659840-1842846814440819","game_id":"steam-4659840","kind":"announcement","title":"This feature could change the game's genre!","summary":"Hey everyone!As the demo release is drawing closer I want talk more about the game's mechanics. Today's focus is the Black Market Arena. A rather unique feature for a shop-sim game since it's basically it's own self-contained autobattler game. I say \"self-contained\" because it's pretty independent from the shop part of the game. You could just make weapons and try them in the arena if you'd like. Who cares about the realm and their need of swords.Without further ado, let's do a deep dive in the ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-02T15:47:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814440819","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:55:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4659840-1841579228676203","game_id":"steam-4659840","kind":"announcement","title":"I can finally talk about this!","summary":"Hey Weaponsmiths!I have big news that I can finally share! Fantasy Weaponsmith Simulator is being published by RockGame!I'm really excited to have RockGame's marketing expertise behind the game, so all the love and sweat I've poured into it can finally reach a lot more of you.So, what does that mean for you?Nothing changes. The game stays exactly the vision I set out to buildWhat does it mean for me?I get to focus more on the development of the game and bring in life the visions I have for itRoc","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-24T17:32:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228676203","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:55:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4659840-1839041357036181","game_id":"steam-4659840","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest has Ended","summary":"Hey Weaponsmiths!The Fantasy Weaponsmith Simulator playtest has come to an end. Here's what happens next.To everyone who gave it a try, hammered a blade, argued with stubborn customers, decorated their shop, and then told me exactly what felt wrong about it — thank you! Your feedback helped shape the game in the best way,What's next?Over the course of the playtest I squashed a huge number of bugs and rebalanced the economy and the systems around it — the forge, haggling, demand, progression. All","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-27T17:00:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357036181","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:55:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4659840-1838407329267514","game_id":"steam-4659840","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest is Extended!","summary":"Hi Weaponsmiths,Quick Update: I am extending the playtest!It will be running until the 27th of July 2026I am grateful to everyone who tried the game and told me their feedback! I've got a few more things I want to test, tune and break before I wrap this up.Rather than rush it, I'd rather give myself the extra time to get quality feedback and make sure the next build is better.If you've been meaning to play, now it's a great time. And if you've already been playing - thank you!More news soon. Go ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-20T21:07:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329267514","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:55:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4659840-1835871199305176","game_id":"steam-4659840","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest is LIVE","summary":"Hey weaponsmiths!The playtest is officially open! You can now enter the forge, craft some weapons, haggle with stubborn customers, and run your very own weaponsmithing business.I genuinely can't wait to see what you all think.A quick heads-up though: I'll be letting people in gradually, in multiple rounds over the course of the playtest. So if you don't get access right away, don't worry! You're not forgotten, and you haven't done anything wrong. I'm opening the doors a bit at a time so I can ke","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-18T18:26:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199305176","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:55:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4659840-1834602721184110","game_id":"steam-4659840","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest Signups Are LIVE!","summary":"Greetings, everyone!I am thrilled to announce that playtest signups are officially open. This is your chance to step into your very own fantasy weapon shop before anyone else, hammer glowing steel into something legendary, and help shape the game as I build toward release.Your feedback during this phase is invaluableWhat You'll Be PlayingThis is a cozy blacksmithing shop sim with a crafting system that goes way deeper than it looks.Create 40,000+ different weapons 